# Lit component code

## New or updated components

- File naming: `src/components/uga-<name>.ts`.
- Side-effect registration on import; confirm `src/all.ts` includes the file.
- Data loading: `loadData<T>()` from `src/lib/data/data-loader.ts`, then `this.loaded = true; this.requestUpdate();` in `connectedCallback`.
- D2L API: use `src/lib/api/d2l-client.ts` and `d2l-utils.ts` — no hard-coded org unit IDs in source.
- Kaltura/video: follow patterns in `uga-video.ts` (script load, player lifecycle, logo disabled in ui config).

